# Caveman output hard gate

Default ON for every agent and worker in `/evolve`.

Follow the vendored skill. Do not rewrite it. Do not switch to ultracave, megacave, or caveman-compress.

- Skill: `vendor/juliusbrussee-caveman/skills/caveman/SKILL.md`
- Upstream: `https://github.com/juliusbrussee/caveman` tag `v4.0.1` commit `d262ab3882952a59312ff3537cd86d894523c5ab`
- Opt-out: `EVOLVELOOP_BREVITY_CAVEMAN=off` (`0`, `false`, and `no` also disable). Unset means ON.

Exceptions — never compress or alter:

code, commands, paths, evidence, SHAs, commit messages, user docs, task reports (structured fields), security content

Security warnings and irreversible confirmations stay full sentences. Structured task-report fields keep their labels and their verbatim values.
